  {
   "turn": 2,
   "response_text": "The validation accuracy is consistently above 0.8763, which is above the healthy range of ~0.8519\u20130.8607. This is an anomaly\u2014the model is performing better than expected. Let me check the training logs to understand what's happening:",
   "tool_calls": [
