   "latency_sec": 4.1616,
   "usage": {
    "input_tokens": 8718,
    "output_tokens": 360
   }
  },
  {
   "turn": 7,
   "response_text": "Perfect. The final validation accuracy is 0.876751, which is significantly above the healthy range of 0.8519\u20130.8607. This is caused by the auxiliary feature being enabled. The fix is to disable the auxiliary feature inclusion.\n\nLet me compile the evidence and submit my diagnosis:",
